# Agent Command Catalog

## /validate-bronze

Validate NetSuite source data against Bronze Lakehouse tables.

### Arguments

| Argument  | Default   | Description           |
| --------- | --------- | --------------------- |
| --table   | all       | Table to validate     |
| --date    | yesterday | Validation date       |
| --summary | true      | Return summary report |

### Example

```text
/validate-bronze --table transaction
```

### Safety Note

Does not modify source or target data.

---

## /analyze-pipeline-failure

Analyze Microsoft Fabric pipeline failures.

### Arguments

| Argument      | Default  | Description              |
| ------------- | -------- | ------------------------ |
| --error       | required | Error message            |
| --activity    | auto     | Activity name            |
| --suggest-fix | true     | Return remediation steps |

### Example

```text
/analyze-pipeline-failure --error "AADSTS700082"
```

### Safety Note

Read-only diagnostic operation.

---

## /convert-to-fabric

Convert SQL Server syntax into Fabric SQL or PySpark.

### Arguments

| Argument | Default    | Description     |
| -------- | ---------- | --------------- |
| --target | fabric-sql | Output platform |
| --source | sql-server | Source platform |

### Example

```text
/convert-to-fabric --target pyspark
```

### Safety Note

Generated code must be reviewed before deployment.

