## /data-quality-check

Run standard data quality assessment.

### Arguments

| Argument | Default  | Description      |
| -------- | -------- | ---------------- |
| --table  | required | Dataset          |
| --checks | standard | Validation rules |

### Example

```text
/data-quality-check --table Customer_All
```

### Safety Note

Assessment only. No data updates.

---

## /validate-invoice

Validate invoice records before NetSuite submission.

### Arguments

| Argument        | Default | Description   |
| --------------- | ------- | ------------- |
| --business-unit | all     | Business unit |
| --invoice-date  | current | Invoice date  |

### Example

```text
/validate-invoice --business-unit Sirus
```

### Safety Note

Validation only. Does not submit invoices.
